  m_Name: 001-bartolina
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CardData
  characterName: Bartolina Quispe
  promptText: "We live beside Bolivia\u2019s great lithium reserve. A mining company
    promises our village schools and clean-energy jobs. But their operation would
    drain and poison the springs we drink from and irrigate with. \n\nDo I accept
    their \u201Cgreen\u201D future if it costs us our water?"
  leftAnswer: Yes, take the deal; schools and jobs will help your people now.
  rightAnswer: No, refuse the mine; water and health must come first.
